# Operate the town waypoint and travel to the Cold Plains (level 3).
# The character knows both waypoints (specs/world/waypoints.md §5–§6).
scenario 1
name waypoint-travel
game 1.14d
seed 0x00001234
init 644409375         # game +0x7C (tools/original-hooks.md §2): the DRLG seed
difficulty normal
expansion yes
end 150

char save ScnSor     # the save the original side loads (handoff §3)
char class 1
char area 0 1
char at default
char waypoint 1
char waypoint 3

record s2c rng units
snapshot every 25

at 2 msg InteractWithEntity type=2 id=@wp
at 50 msg TakeOrCloseWp wp=@wp level=3
